C
C    Detector example: ILD at ILC - updated for IDR+some corrections
C
BF: BFIELD=3.5

TYPE:  BARREL_TRACKING

C       R: mean radius of the central beam pipe, 0.05 cm Be at r = 1.35-1.40 cm (X0 unchanged, 35.28 cm),
C       from k4geo v00-24 (b0087c8c, key4hep release 2026-04-08), ILD_common_v02/Beampipe_o1_v01_01.xml
